	(text "U1 = LOLIN C3 mini, plugged into J3/J4 (2x pin socket 1x08). J3 = EN..3V3 side, J4 = TX..5V side\nU1 itself is not on the board (on_board=no), only J3/J4 are assembled\nI2C: SDA = GPIO8, SCL = GPIO10 (Wire.begin(8, 10)); RX = GPIO20, TX = GPIO21\n\nJ1 = pin socket for ADS1115 module:\n1 VDD, 2 GND, 3 SCL, 4 SDA, 5 ADDR (GND -> 0x48),\n6 ALRT, 7 A0, 8 A1, 9 A2, 10 A3\n\nR1||R2 = 75 ohm shunt to GND: 4-20 mA -> 0.3-1.5 V at A0\nJ2: 1 = red (+24V), 2 = black (signal)\nU2 = Mornsun B0524S-1WR3 (LCSC C133013), soldered in, unregulated 24 V / 42 mA\nC1 = 4.7 uF/50 V at input, C2 = 1 uF/50 V at output (datasheet)\n-Vout is tied to GND on the board (converter is isolated)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170 70 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "26bc457f-e4f8-4422-8fed-1de4559e3e8c")
	)
